{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>Console Shop Simulator</strong>&quot; is a relaxing first-person simulation that brings every detail of running a store to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Store Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your store, optimizing for efficiency and aesthetics. Decide where CDs and consoles will be displayed, manage your shelves, and ensure a smooth shopping experience for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Product Supply</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock using the in-game computer. Unpack products, organize them in your storage area, and place them on the appropriate shelves for your products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade with incoming customers, buy products from them and give other products in return!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization options, Licenses, Employees and Upgrades are disabled.\u00a0The demo will end once you complete seven days in the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785240?t=1749490569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785240?t=1749490569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785240/d7d8dad2e66dcb7dc1ed42e6ffa7b81bf8e3da2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749490569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785240/d7d8dad2e66dcb7dc1ed42e6ffa7b81bf8e3da2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749490569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":